appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Language for Talking About Jobs & Work "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In English, it is important to talk about jobs, what they involve and what you are responsible for in a company. Look at how the following words are used:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Work</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" work <span class=\\\"italic\\\">for</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a company\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"work <span class=\\\"italic\\\">in</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a department\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"work <span class=\\\"italic\\\">as</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a manager (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">job</span>)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"work <span class=\\\"italic\\\">with</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the president (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">someone</span>)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>He <span class=\"strong\">worked for</span> MechaTech.<li> He <span class=\"strong\">worked in</span> the sales department.</li><li>He <span class=\"strong\">worked as</span> an assistant. </li><li> He <span class=\"strong\">worked closely</span> with the CEO.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Look After, Deal With</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You look after:<ul><li>accounts</li><li> equipment</li><li> details</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You deal with:<ul><li>problems</li><li>people</li><li> customers / clients</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>He was <span class=\"strong\">looking after</span> the accounts and <span class=\"strong\">dealing with clients.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Be responsible for / be in charge of</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" be responsible for <br>be in charge of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>noun</li><li>-ing</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li> She <span class=\"strong\">was responsible for</span> communications. </li><li>He <span class=\"strong\">is in charge of</span> acquiring new clients.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Head of</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li> She'<span class=\"strong\">s the head of</span> the Fashion department.</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You could also say"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li> She <span class=\"strong\">runs</span> the Fashion department. </li><li>She <span class=\"strong\">is in charge of</span> the Fashion department.</li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Language For Starting a Conversation With a Stranger "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are certain expressions and words you use to greet and start a conversation with a stranger. Look at the charts below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meeting Someone You Don't Know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Pleased/Nice/Lovely</span> to meet you.           \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You too. <br>And you!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Follow-up Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How was your <span class=\\\"strong\\\">trip/drive/journey</span>?<br><br><br>Was the traffic OK? <br>How are you finding it here? It is very busy, isn't it? \\t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Not bad, thanks. <br/>Yes, everything was fine, thanks.<br><br>Yes, it is. But I'm really enjoying it, thanks.<br>It's not bad. I'm having a good time.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "My name's Michael Carter. <span class=\"strong\">Pleased to meet you. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">And you</span>, Mr. Carter. I'm Robert Amo."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">How was your drive? Was the traffic alright? </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Yes, everything was fine, thanks.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "punctual   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is always on time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to be punctual. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you can use to talk about people in a workplace. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be responsible for "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be in charge of "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I was responsible for communications. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accounts "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a department in a company that is responsible for keeping records of the amount of money spent and received "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I looked after some of the company's accounts as well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to work closely with "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to work together with another person "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You will be working closely with the members of that department."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "proficient "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to do something well  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are looking for someone who is proficient."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "skillful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "showing a lot of ability "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Examples: He is very skillful."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "thoughtful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thinking of things you can do or say to make people happy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Thanks for being so thoughtful."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the head of "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person in charge of a department "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is the head of the fashion department. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "compelling "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that can capture your interest or attention  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her resume is quite compelling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob02aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are working and have to write about your boss."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adjectives to describe the personality and behaviour in the office. Are they caring? Are they mean?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph about your boss, include 70-80 words in your paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your paragraph. Then, read your paragraph aloud to a a partner. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about my boss."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about their job. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives to describe their personality and behaviour. "}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [],