6le04ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le04ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Good afternoon. How can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Good afternoon, my name's Peter Smith. I have a meeting with Ms Ellison at 3 pm.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Ah yes. You are here quite early. Please take a seat. I'll let Ms. Ellison know you're here.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I like to be punctual."}, {"time": "19000", "image": "engenn6le04ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Mr Smith? I'm Janet Ellison. Pleasure to meet you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And you, Ms. Ellison. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: How was the drive? Was the traffic OK?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, everything was fine, thanks. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Now from what I remember, you worked for Mechatech and you were responsible for communications.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's right. I worked in the software department and also looked after some of our accounts."}, {"time": "43000", "image": "engenn6le04ob02re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Impressive. Sounds like you have the necessary qualifications for this position. We wanted someone who was proficient and skillful. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks. That's very thoughtful of you to say. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You will also be working closely with Miranda Morehouse if she accepts the position. She will be the head of the fashion department. She will be in charge of establishing, maintaining and acquiring new clients. Her resume is quite compelling.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can't wait! I look forward to meeting her!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}